MID_SE_Led_Esm_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_001: Hey, Leda! That balm you gave me... It works! My\nskin's already way smoother!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_002: I bet it is. Your skin looks lovely! You've got quite\na glow about you.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_003: And all it took was a little bit of polish. I'm really\nglad that balm worked for you.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_004: Really? You think so? Hehe. Coming from you, that\nmeans a lot.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_005: Oh, I'm sure I'm not the only one who's noticed. I bet\nyou've been turning heads all over town.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_006: Maybe... But I'm not interested. I only have eyes for\nmy Sweetie!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_007: And how did Dietrich react?
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_008: It was a disaster! I'm doing everything I can to catch\nhis eye... But no change. He's as tight-lipped as ever!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_009: Heh... Yeah, can't say I'm surprised. That one would\nbe tough to crack. Um... Oh! I have an idea...
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_010: Here, try this. It's a perfumed oil. I hear this is what\nthe goddess Kalla herself uses.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_011: All you have to do is massage it through your hair.\nThen, when the breeze blows, you'll smell like roses.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_012: You're giving me the hair oil of the GODS? If that\nwon't turn Sweetie's head, what will?
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_013: Hehe. Who knows. But it can't hurt to make\nyourself seem a bit more...refined.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_014: Ooh, smell that! All we have back home is\nsea-beast blubber.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_015: Hehehe. How can you smell it when you haven't\neven opened the bottle? Come on, try it for real.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_016: Well, if you say so... I just hope Sweetie likes it!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_017: Oh wow. Wow... This is... This is REALLY strong!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_018: Hey, you alright? You don't look so good. Let's...put\nthe cork back in the bottle.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_019: Sorry... It just kinda punched me in the face! Maybe\nit's a little much for me...
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_020: I think I'm going to keep this closed. Then I should\nbe OK.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_021: Wow, you really did smell it before the bottle was\nopen! That's amazing, but...
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_022: I'm not sure how to make this work for you. I could\ntry to dilute it, but that would probably just ruin it.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_023: Me and my nose! I was on the road to elegance,\nbut I crashed!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_024: Leda, I'll level with you... You're so sophisticated.\nYou can get any man you want.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_025: That is not true. I can't even get the one man I want.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_026: Look, Esmeralda. You have so much potential.\nLet's forget the oil and focus on something else.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_027: No can do! I've set my mind to it!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_028: You nearly fainted! You do not have to force yourself\nto smell like roses.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_029: There's nothing I can't do! I've made up my mind.\nI WILL smell like a rose. Sweetie? Just you wait!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_C_030: Nothing you can't do, huh? Who am I to stop you.\nKnock yourself out, Esme.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_001: Ta-da! Here I am, smelling like a rose! What do you\nthink?
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_002: What? Oh wow, you smell wonderful!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_003: It did take a little trial and error. First I held my nose,\nthen I stuffed it up with cotton...
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_004: No matter what I tried, the scent was overwhelming.\nSo I decided I'd just hold my breath.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_005: Hold your breath? From when you uncork the\nbottle until...your hair absorbs the oil?
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_006: That's right! Till the smell dies down. I just think of it\nlike...jumping into the sea! Which I've done. A lot.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_007: That's an...interesting...solution. And probably a\ndangerous one. But you did what you said you'd do!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_008: I did! I worried I might pass out...or even die! But the\npower of love saw me through.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_009: I know how it feels to want to achieve a goal so\nbadly that you're willing to die for it.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_010: So, tell me... How did Dietrich react this time?
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_011: He...didn't. I thought he'd notice, but no. That's my\nSweetie, I guess. It's just how he is.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_012: For someone who nearly died of rose-scented hair,\nyou seem pretty happy.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_013: Well, all this trouble showed me that Sweetie really\nis the one.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_014: I nearly killed myself with this stuff, and he didn't\neven notice!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_015: But I still love him. And I realized that all this was\nsilly. I need to focus on what matters.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_016: {SetColor=Gray}Hm, she's a tough one. She pursued her goal with no\nregard for her own well-being.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_017: Esmeralda... You are very impressive. And you're\ntotally wasted on this man.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_018: What do you mean by that?
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_019: Let's just say there's a lot more I could teach you\nabout using your feminine wiles. If you'll let me.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_020: I could help you blossom into a flower so bewitching\nthat no one could resist you...not even Dietrich.
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_021: Bewitching? That sounds good, but, um...
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_022: Sweetie is the only one for meee!
MID_SE_Led_Esm_B_023: Aw, I was just kidding! She's got a lot to learn, but\nit'll be fun to see what life has in store for this one.